  - m_Id: 11648701992968
    m_Localized: Reveal the contents of the three doors in the next path choice.
      Labels appear on the doors before entering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11648701992969
    m_Localized: Resurrects all cards in the graveyard and returns them to the deck.
      Cannot be used in battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11648701992970
    m_Localized: Thaws all cards on cooldown and returns them to the deck. Cannot
      be used in battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11648701992971
    m_Localized: Increase your Attack Vigor die by one step for the current or next
      room. Cannot be used in Boss or Miniboss rooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11648701992972
    m_Localized: Permanently boosts a pawn deployed on the field by +2. Each card
      can receive only one Ruby Seal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11648701992973
    m_Localized: Double all experience and gold gained in the next room.
    m_Metadata:
