    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950927888498
    m_Localized: 'Costo 5 mana: Diventi non bersagliabile. Quando resti l''unica
      pedina torni bersagliabile, ma difendi con vantaggio.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950927888499
    m_Localized: Evoca Sgherri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950927888500
    m_Localized: 'Costo 8 mana: Evoca 2 sgherri di Potenza 2 che intercettano gli
      attacchi diretti e ad area. Non hanno un turno e non possono attaccare. Quando
      uno muore, tutte le tue pedine ottengono +1 Potenza; la Purificazione li dissolve
      senza attivare il bonus.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950961442816
    m_Localized: 'Lesson unavailable: Thief cards are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831424
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Thief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831425
    m_Localized: MANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831426
    m_Localized: 'Abilities cost mana. Your reserve cannot exceed 10 points and recovers
      between rooms, not every turn: spending it wisely is half the game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831427
    m_Localized: THE TECHNIQUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831428
    m_Localized: THE AURA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831429
    m_Localized: THE FACTION TRIANGLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831430
    m_Localized: 'Now you know all three: Might beats Cunning, Cunning beats Magic,
      and Magic beats Might. The triangle is complete, and no faction is the strongest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831431
    m_Localized: TARGET COLORS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831432
    m_Localized: 'When you attack, an aura appears around enemy pawns: green means
      you have advantage, yellow means both belong to the same faction, and red means
      you have disadvantage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831433
    m_Localized: roll the Vigor die plus a die one step lower and add both results
      to Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831434
    m_Localized: reduce an enemy's Vigor die by one step for its next combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831435
    m_Localized: activate the class effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831436
    m_Localized: ' It is the most expensive ability in the game: half your reserve
      at once, so use it when it matters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831437
    m_Localized: THE ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831438
    m_Localized: '{0}: press ABILITY and {1}. It costs {2} mana.{3}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831439
    m_Localized: when it rolls poorly, it rerolls the die automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831440
    m_Localized: build Fury whenever a pawn falls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831441
    m_Localized: trigger automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831442
    m_Localized: AN ABILITY YOU DO NOT PRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831443
    m_Localized: '{0} has no ABILITY button: its ability is passive. It will {1},
      at all times and without spending mana.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831444
    m_Localized: 'Every class has a second ability: its Supreme. The {0}''s Supreme
      is {1} ({2} mana): {3}


      You can try it here, but you do not own it yet.
      Learn it at the Techniques altar in the Sanctuary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831445
    m_Localized: '{0} belongs to the {1} faction, which beats {2} and loses to {3}.
      With advantage, roll two Vigor dice and keep the higher result; with disadvantage,
      keep the lower result.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831446
    m_Localized: 'Magician lesson unavailable: pawns are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831447
    m_Localized: THE MAGICIAN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831448
    m_Localized: Learn how to use the Magician. First use a basic attack, then the
      Magician's ability, and finally its Supreme against a new wave of enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831449
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Magician
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831450
    m_Localized: BASIC ATTACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831451
    m_Localized: Start with a normal strike. Press CONTINUE, then ATTACK, and select
      only the Power-2 Magician pawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831452
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831453
    m_Localized: Now use ABILITY on the Power-4 Magician pawn. It costs {0} mana
      and reduces its next Vigor die by one step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831454
    m_Localized: EXPLOIT THE PENALTY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831455
    m_Localized: Its Vigor die has been reduced. Press CONTINUE, then ATTACK, and
      strike the same Power-4 pawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831456
    m_Localized: 'NEW WAVE: SUPREME'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831457
    m_Localized: 'Three more Magician pawns have appeared. Press CONTINUE and use
      SUPREME: Fireball costs {0} mana and attacks all enemies at once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831458
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN LESSON COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831459
    m_Localized: You used the Magician's basic attack, ability, and Supreme. Press
      CONTINUE to receive your reward and continue toward the Thief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831460
    m_Localized: SEE THE THIEF IN ACTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831461
    m_Localized: 'See the Thief''s passive ability in action: let us fight! You will
      attack one pawn from each faction and watch a low roll turn into a victory
      thanks to the reroll.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831462
    m_Localized: 'SAME FACTION: YELLOW'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831463
    m_Localized: 'The first roll would have lost, but the Thief rerolled it and won.
      Now repeat the attack against the Thief: the yellow aura indicates the same
      faction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831464
    m_Localized: 'DISADVANTAGE: RED'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831465
    m_Localized: 'The reroll also turned the second fight around. Now attack the
      Warrior: the red aura indicates disadvantage, but the passive ability can still
      save a low roll.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831466
    m_Localized: YOU ARE DOING GREAT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831467
    m_Localized: You have what it takes! Go to the Shop to receive your reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831468
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831469
    m_Localized: THIEF TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831470
    m_Localized: WARRIOR TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831471
    m_Localized: 'Lesson unavailable: required cards are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831472
    m_Localized: WELCOME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831473
    m_Localized: 'This is a guided room: I will explain a few interface elements,
      then we will fight together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831474
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831475
    m_Localized: THE MANA POOL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831476
    m_Localized: The blue pool is your mana; the red one belongs to your opponent.
      Mana powers abilities, supreme techniques, and basic attacks. You recover it
      when you block or at the end of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831477
    m_Localized: VIGOR DICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831478
    m_Localized: These icons show your Vigor die and your opponent's. In each clash,
      both dice are rolled and added to the pawn's Power. The highest total wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831479
    m_Localized: ATTACK THE WEAKEST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831480
    m_Localized: Attack the monster with 4 Power. You are stronger and unlikely to
      lose. Press ATTACK and select the pawn with 4 Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831481
    m_Localized: TRY THE STRONGEST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831482
    m_Localized: 'The 10-Power Warrior remains. You have 6 Power: attack him and
      see what happens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831483
    m_Localized: NOW TRY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831484
    m_Localized: 'Same pawn, same basic attack: only your Power has changed. Strike
      the 10-Power Warrior.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831485
    m_Localized: LESSON COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831486
    m_Localized: 'You have seen the three essentials: mana pays for abilities, Heavy
      Strike doubles the dice, and the technique raises Power. The supreme technique
      is not yours yet: you learn it at the Sanctuary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831487
    m_Localized: THE WARRIOR'S ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831488
    m_Localized: 'The 4-Power Warrior is down. The next has 7 Power, and Power alone
      would not be enough. Press ABILITY: Heavy Strike costs {0} mana, rolls two
      Vigor dice, and adds their results.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120950969831489
    m_Localized: MATHEMATICALLY IMPOSSIBLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831490
    m_Localized: You rolled the maximum Vigor result, 4, but 6 + 4 only reaches 10.
      The 10-Power Warrior rolls at least 1 and reaches 11, so you cannot beat him
      with a D4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831491
    m_Localized: THE WARRIOR'S SUPREME TECHNIQUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120950969831492
    m_Localized: 'Supreme techniques are special moves unlocked at the Sanctuary.
      In this lesson you will try Empowerment ({0} mana): it raises Power by 2, or
      by 4 when this is your last pawn. You are alone, so your Power becomes 10.
      Press SUPREME.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883319116726694
  - m_Id: 6120951036940288
    m_Localized: Spada Maledetta
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951036940289
    m_Localized: Evocazione di Jurinashor. Non agisce. Ogni Spada Maledetta viva
      conferisce +2 Potenza a Jurinashor in attacco e difesa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951036940290
    m_Localized: Jurinashor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951036940291
    m_Localized: Jurinashor, il Necromante dell'Infestazione.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951116632064
    m_Localized: unexpected opportunity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948544
    m_Localized: rinuncia alla Prova Lampo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948545
    m_Localized: '{key}: pubblicita'' rimossa dall''acquisto.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948546
    m_Localized: Fake Ad Test Canvas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948547
    m_Localized: Backdrop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948548
    m_Localized: MMO UI Test Panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948549
    m_Localized: Prova annunci fake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948550
    m_Localized: Apri i due formati per verificare frame, font, chiusura e ricompensa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948551
    m_Localized: Interstitial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948552
    m_Localized: Prova interstitial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948553
    m_Localized: Rewarded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948554
    m_Localized: Prova rewarded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948555
    m_Localized: Nessun annuncio mostrato
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948556
    m_Localized: Annuncio in corso...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948557
    m_Localized: 'Esito: {adResult.Outcome}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948558
    m_Localized: RICOMPENSA FRA {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948559
    m_Localized: CHIUDIBILE FRA {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948560
    m_Localized: MMO UI Panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948561
    m_Localized: '[Music] Riproduco ''{clip.name}'' (volume {source.volume:0.00})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948562
    m_Localized: "EQUIPAGGIA: questa carta pu\xF2 essere sacrificata per potenziare
      permanentemente un alleato di +{0}. Se l'alleato equipaggiato muore, muore
      anche questa carta."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948563
    m_Localized: 'EQUIP: this card can be sacrificed to permanently grant an ally
      +{0}. If the equipped ally dies, this card dies too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948564
    m_Localized: "AUSR\xDCSTEN: Diese Karte kann geopfert werden, um einem Verb\xFCndeten
      dauerhaft +{0} zu gew\xE4hren. Stirbt der ausger\xFCstete Verb\xFCndete, stirbt
      auch diese Karte."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948565
    m_Localized: "EQUIPAR: esta carta puede sacrificarse para otorgar permanentemente
      +{0} a un aliado. Si el aliado equipado muere, esta carta tambi\xE9n muere."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951619948566
    m_Localized: "\xC9QUIPER : cette carte peut \xEAtre sacrifi\xE9e pour accorder
      d\xE9finitivement +{0} \xE0 un alli\xE9. Si l'alli\xE9 \xE9quip\xE9 meurt,
      cette carte meurt aussi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
