    m_Localized: EQUIPAGGIAMENTO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725906
    m_Localized: "Chi attacca questa carta riceve il bonus indicato. Pi\xF9 marchi
      sullo stesso bersaglio non si sommano."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725907
    m_Localized: Anyone attacking this card receives the indicated bonus. Multiple
      marks on the same target do not stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725908
    m_Localized: "Wer diese Karte angreift, erh\xE4lt den angegebenen Bonus. Mehrere
      Markierungen auf demselben Ziel sind nicht kumulativ."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725909
    m_Localized: Quien ataque esta carta recibe el bono indicado. Varias marcas sobre
      el mismo objetivo no se acumulan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725910
    m_Localized: "Toute personne attaquant cette carte re\xE7oit le bonus indiqu\xE9.
