  - m_Id: 6179912779993088
    m_Localized: Purse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912796770304
    m_Localized: Initiative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912796770305
    m_Localized: Mastery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964608
    m_Localized: Opportunities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964609
    m_Localized: +{0} starting gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964610
    m_Localized: -{0}% merchant prices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964611
    m_Localized: +{0} to the first initiative die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964612
    m_Localized: +{0} to the second initiative die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964613
    m_Localized: +{0} to the third initiative die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964614
    m_Localized: -{0}% to all thresholds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964615
    m_Localized: +{0} mana on each room change
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964616
    m_Localized: +{0} maximum mana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964617
    m_Localized: -{0}% recovery cost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964618
    m_Localized: +{0} Power on the first attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964619
    m_Localized: Travel Fund
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964620
    m_Localized: Start each run with gold already in your purse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964621
    m_Localized: Kind Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964622
    m_Localized: Cards and upgrades cost less gold at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964623
    m_Localized: Smith's Temper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964624
    m_Localized: When the deck is forged, random cards gain +1 permanent Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964625
    m_Localized: First Deal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964626
    m_Localized: The first merchant upgrade you buy is free, once per run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964627
    m_Localized: Vanguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964628
    m_Localized: Your first initiative die counts for more than it shows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964629
    m_Localized: Flanker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964630
    m_Localized: Your second initiative die also counts for more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964631
    m_Localized: Rearguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964632
    m_Localized: Your third initiative die also counts for more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964633
    m_Localized: Opening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964634
    m_Localized: 'You always open the fight: your first initiative die beats every
      number on the field.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964635
    m_Localized: Apprentice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964636
    m_Localized: 'Each run level comes sooner: every threshold needs less experience.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964637
    m_Localized: Focus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964638
    m_Localized: Recover mana whenever you enter a new room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964639
    m_Localized: Reserve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964640
    m_Localized: 'Your mana reserve holds more: its cap rises from 10 to 12.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964641
    m_Localized: Trance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964642
    m_Localized: The first basic ability used in each room costs no mana. Supremes
      still cost mana.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964643
    m_Localized: Recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964644
    m_Localized: At the market, returning a card from the graveyard to the deck costs
      less gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964645
    m_Localized: Challenger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964646
    m_Localized: Your first attack in every fight against a boss or miniboss hits
      harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964647
    m_Localized: Seeker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964648
    m_Localized: Every loot room grants extra consumables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964649
    m_Localized: Second Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6179912800964650
    m_Localized: 'The first pawn you lose each run does not go to the graveyard:
      it returns to the deck immediately.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
